ggml-webgpu: a Q4_K / Q6_K MMVQ mat-vec (subgroups only) with workgroups of 32 or 64 threads that each
walk many blocks, so the per-(column, row) reductions are paid once per row instead of once per block;
d/dmin and the Q8_1 d/s are read as one word each and Q6_K's 2-byte-aligned runs as 5 words. Same
per-value math; partial sums are added in a different order, so results can differ in the last bits.

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-webgpu/ggml-webgpu-shader-lib.hpp b/ggml/src/ggml-webgpu/ggml-webgpu-shader-lib.hpp
